ma M8179)  | 0.184 g/L  |  | 1.01 mM\nL121: 3  | ZnSO_{4}•7H_{2}O\nL122: (Sigma Z 0251)  | 0.023 g/L  |  | 0.08 mM\nL123: 4  | (NH_{4})_{6}Mo_{7}O_{24}•4H_{2}O\nL124: (Mallinckrodt 3420)  | 0.007 g/L  |  | 0.01 mM\nL125: 5  | Co(NO_{3})_{2}•6H_{2}O\nL126: (ACROS 10026-22-9)  | 0.012 g/L  |  | 0.04 mM\nL127: 6  | KBr\nL128: (Sigma 449962)  | 0.015 g/L  |  | 0.13 mM\nL129: 7  | NiSO_{4}(NH_{4})SO_{4}•6H_{2}O\nL130: (Sigma 574988)  | 0.016 g/L  |  | 0.09 mM\nL131: 8  | VOSO_{4}•2H_{2}O\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBBM Bold Trace Stock Solution Recipe | UTEX Culture Collection of Algae (https://utex.org/products/bbm-bold-trace-stock-solution)\nciteturn36view3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 4 days ago; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://utex.org/products/bbm-bold-trace-stock-solution\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 194\nL0: ### Analyzing your theme...\nL1: \nL2: This may take a few moments. Please don't close this window.\nL3: \nL4: ### Verifying your theme\nL5: \nL6: ## Oops, your theme needs a little help!\nL7: #### We found a price field that our auto-setup tool couldn't configure.\nL8: \nL9: Our expert team can take care of it. Just click Get Expert Install and we'll send you an email when it's ready!\nL10: \nL11: If everything looks okay to you, you can Ignore this warning.\nL12: \nL13: [Button: Ignore] [Button: Get Expert Install]\nL14: \nL15: 【0†Menu】 【1†0】\nL16:   * 【2†Products】\nL17:     * 【3†Living Algal Strains】\nL18:     * 【4†☰Algae Express】\nL19:     * 【5†Newly Accessioned Algal Strains】\nL20:     * 【6†Algal Culture Media】\nL21:       * 【7†Media List】\nL22:       * 【8†Media Kits & Add-Ins】\nL23:     * 【9†Teaching Kits】\nL24:     * 【10†Bulk Volume Microalgae】\nL25:     * 【11†Photobioreactors & Accessories】\nL26:       * 【11†UTEX Photobioreactor Packages】\nL27:       * 【12†RGB-LED Lighting Platform】\nL28:   * 【13†Services】\nL29:     * 【14†Training Workshops】\nL30:     * 【15†UTEX Algal