\nL88:     * 【22†UTEX Facility Reservations】\nL89:     * 【7†Algal Culture Media Recipes】\nL90:     * 【23†Cryopreservation of Microalgae】\nL91:     * 【24†Public Strain Accessioning】\nL92:     * 【25†Unique Algal Collections Overview】\nL93:     * 【26†Reference Literature】\nL94:     * 【27†Other Culture Collections & Resources】\nL95:     * 【28†UTEX Visual Assets Guide†company-43851.frontify.com】\nL96: \nL97:   * 【29†Help  】\nL98:     * 【30†About UTEX】\nL99:     * 【31†Announcements】\nL100:     * 【32†Requests For Proforma Invoice/Quote】\nL101:     * 【33†Replacement Requests】\nL102:     * 【34†US Academic & Government Discount Requests】\nL103:     * 【35†FAQs†utex.freshdesk.com】\nL104:     * 【36†Order Status】\nL105:     * 【37†Contact UTEX】\nL106: \nL107:   * 【32†Request A Quote】\nL108:   * 【38†FAQs†utex.freshdesk.com】\nL109: # BBM Bold Trace Stock Solution Recipe\nL110: \nL111: #### Directions\nL112: #### For 1 L Total\nL113:   1. To approximately 900 mL of dH_{2}O add the following components in the order specified while stirring continuously.\nL114:   2. Bring total volume to 1 L with dH_{2}O.\nL115:   3. Store at room temperature in darkness.\nL116: #  | Component  | Amount  | Stock Solution Concentration  | Final Concentration\nL117: --- | --- | --- | --- | ---\nL118: 1  | H_{2}SO_{4} conc.  | 10-mL  |  |\nL119: 2  | ZnSO_{4}•7H_{2}O  | 8.82 g  | 0.44 mg/L  | 1.50 µM\nL120: 3  | MnCl•4H_{2}O  | 1.44 g  | 0.072 mg/L  | 0.36 µM\nL121: 4  | MoO_{3}  | 0.71 g  | 0.38 mg/L  | 0.26 µM\nL122: 5  | CuSO_{4}•5H_{2}O  | 1.57 g  | 0.78 mg/L  | 0.31 µM\nL123: 6  | Co(NO_{3})_{2}•6H_{2}O  | 0.49 g  | 0.025 mg/L  | 0.084 µM\n"
